{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "levora-smoke-tests-v1",
    "name": "Levora API Smoke & Integration Tests",
    "description": "Comprehensive automated smoke tests for Levora NestJS backend covering Health, Auth, and Users endpoints.\n\n### Execution Order & Newman Cookie Isolation:\n- All unauthenticated tests and validation error checks (expecting 401 Unauthorized or 422 Unprocessable Entity) are intentionally sequenced at the beginning of the test suite before any user creation or login steps.\n- This ensures Newman's cookie jar remains completely empty when executing unauthenticated tests, eliminating false positives caused by automatic session cookie persistence across requests.\n- Authenticated requests explicitly supply the Authorization header using collection variables.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "testEmail",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "testPassword",
      "value": "Password123!",
      "type": "string"
    },
